{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-05_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-05","title":"遗忘之地","storyCode":"7-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"ffa908ba804bdbd5ffae77916e8a5178c87a13acd1e13f0d080fc7537ed29a2e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"流血。刺穿。撕裂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这不对。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"我们。敌人。人。\n哀嚎，惨叫，呻吟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这不对！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......！","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不能接受。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想问问题。你可以问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......是第一次看迷迭香战斗吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你不好受，但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我。去照看失去战斗能力的敌方伤员。以及，他们中有负责发布消息和接收命令的传令兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的逃脱会对我们的行动造成巨大威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她多大年纪？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"14岁。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你允许她......？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位干员......请让我过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里发生什么事了？我才刚处理完现场......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你刚才是叫我了吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是谁把你推上战场的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是谁把你推上战场的！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这么残忍的事情！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......可怕......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"这绝不是你该承受的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......为什么要让你来做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......！","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"不该这样。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"是我自己。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在说什么？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你自己是什么意思......？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我选择了战斗。我想要战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"有些感觉只有在战场上才能找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"保护了朋友和家人的时候才会感觉到满足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗德岛需要我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"为了阻止更多我一样的人生出来，这片大地在叫我的名字。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"即使如此，你也不......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你不能——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......死亡有把谁当作小孩吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"战争和感染，会因为它们看见的是小孩，就让他们活着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我和阿米娅站在战场上......看到我们，谁的第一印象是“孩子”呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们是“怪物”吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不！！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"这只是你自己的看法。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己是什么，没什么关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想和我的家人一起做有意义的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道Scout吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那是......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道Ace吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我知道。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已经有几天没有看他们的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经忘了许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我只是忘掉，我和无论什么全都丢掉的博士不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，不是这个意思。但你明白的，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白。但可以......别这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我丢掉的只有零零散散的，许多看到的，许多句子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那些感情，那些......我说不出来，只有阿米娅能懂的感情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"却从来没有离开过我。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......我觉得你很复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"比他们说的都要复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"有人说我也很复杂。有人看见我就会害怕。有人说我不该这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们也不知道我为什么会这样，不知道我感受到了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么在这时候突然心痛？为什么在这时候会想要哭呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"明明什么事情都不记得了......为什么眼睛还是很酸，嘴唇也会变干呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"走廊里那块污渍是谁留下的，为什么没被擦掉？为什么在打碎瓷瓶的时候既担心，却还有点开心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"看到花朵就感觉很讨厌，看到虫子反而很好奇，又是为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"在我不记得的那些事情里，到底发生了什么？为什么这一种种感情都涌了上来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我感觉到的干员们身上有着各种各样的不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"到了失去大家的时候，那些感觉，当然全都消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"可为什么......为什么，会有情感这种东西啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么已经感受不到了，眼泪却一直在流、一直停不下来呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是都已经，忘记了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是迷迭香从来不想我拿走这些感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这些突然缠上来的情感，无论它是什么样子，它都属于迷迭香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......也只属于迷迭香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能干涉它们。只要在迷迭香的脑海里还有美好的希望......我就不会这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因为，要做什么，是迷迭香自己决定的，要忘记，也是迷迭香自己去忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"真正地忘记。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香身上发生了什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我还没有那么了解她。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......罗德岛会严格甄别每一个干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"许多干员申请前往战场，都被我们拒绝了。罗德岛会从种种角度判断一个干员是否适合作战任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"作战能力，战术考虑，纪律和身体素质，都是考察的要素，但这都是浅层次的条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在实际的任务中，许多人并不知道如何去信任彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香在这里，是因为她相信我们的指挥和目标，而我们相信她的能力和她的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"请相信我，博士。不，请相信我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你会慢慢看见她......感情的颜色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。谢谢你和煌一起战斗。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"为什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"没什么好谢的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"煌需要更多人和她一起战斗。我也想看她笑的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想看看你的样子。我想看看，Ace和Scout一直在说的你，到底是什么样子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"轮到你来找我了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......使用沉重的大型器械迅速而有力地摧毁敌人，同时兼具惊人的自制力和极强的应变能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香是罗德岛最出类拔萃的歼灭战要员之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"相应的，她的待人方式和说话语气可能会让你感到担忧，她战斗的姿态，相较她的外表，也的确很残酷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也许手持电锯四处大闹的煌还算能让人接受，迷迭香战斗时飞溅的碎片，则的确会让一些人感到不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能使你稍微感到平静一些，我可以给你一点保证作慰藉。假使你确实能被说服的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——迷迭香很少击杀敌人。虽然看上去相当直接，但她的战术旨在解除敌人的战斗能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"譬如说，刚才的战斗中，所有敌人都被成功解除了武装，且并没有人因为迷迭香的攻击而死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她对武器的操控能力比起过去，已经进步了许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我们擒获的敌人是否能得救，取决于我们能否及时击溃整合运动的指挥核心。直到那时，我们才有可能派遣救援队进入核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，当我们必须实施致死性打击以达成战术性目标的时候，伤亡不可避免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还是皱着眉头。是不是还是觉得这些表面现象依然超过了你的想象？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不能接受。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不能理解。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"事实可能也超乎你的想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"令人胆寒的源石技艺和令人惊讶的感知能力，并不是迷迭香成为精英干员的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——迷迭香正是因为成为了精英干员，才表现出了这样的素质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不是判断“我们应该把她送上战场”，而是判断“如果不让她成为这样的战士，后果将不堪设想。”"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什么样的后果？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"说严重一点吧。她身体里渗透出的源石技艺可能会无意识或有意识地屠杀生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"人类的互相毁灭已经成为了一种常态，即使现在这种事已经相当频繁地发生在这片大地上，大多数人却依然还是自己握着兵器和法杖的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"失去自我意识的人，是否还算是人这一话题，我并不想讨论。但人类面临的正是这个问题的应用延伸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“当剥夺了人类个体的自我意识时，剩下的是什么？诞生的又是什么？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“当它剥夺我们的生命时，有罪的究竟是谁？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是造出武器的人，是使用武器的人，还是被当作武器的人？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"又要我猜谜？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我会自己查明的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"随着之后战斗的继续，我也许能为你更多地解释一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便，年龄的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅的假装成熟也许让你产生了一种错觉。当然，也许有，也许没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"被当作武器畏惧的幼小生命，并不会因为表现稚嫩，就可以被看作是普通孩童。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——何况她们已经经历过太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......整理一下你的必备物品。我们差不多要向地面进发了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那阿米娅呢？她也是武器吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可以自己去问她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，这也该由她自己告诉你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希！站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"华法琳。我马上就要出发了，无论要说什么，你都可以直奔主题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道那个预言吧？不对，没有什么是你不知道的，你肯定知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"预言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是因为这个原因允许阿米娅去的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅才是这场行动的总指挥和发起人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"可阿米娅只有一点点大，怎么能做总指挥——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"华法琳，我们离开卡兹戴尔多长时间了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"给我个准确的回答，否则我走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"......两个月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"华法琳......别开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的意思。她长大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，华法琳。岁月如梭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯人的生理变化和血魔生理变化有着难以估量的差别。到现在为止，我们已经离开卡兹戴尔三年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你的时间只过去了一点点，但阿米娅已经成长了许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是先回答我的问题。预言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......“最后的温迪戈将会死在魔王手中？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这个。我知道那个游击队，以及领袖。是他没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"预言原本的句式是“胡尔提克茨之子，萨卡兹的背叛者和血脉末端的不荣誉者将遭萨卡兹的君主出手处决。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那甚至算不上个预言。无论他们所谓的“血脉”是否得到了延续，迄今为止，依然有许多温迪戈还在乌萨斯和哥伦比亚生活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你允许我把几十个算作“许多”的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，结合当时的语境，你应该将它看作是一句威胁。很多人不希望温迪戈们离开卡兹戴尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"最开始说出这句话的可不是你我，既然你也记着，就说明你也觉得很重要。对不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是上年纪了，怎么会相信“预言”这种萨卡兹巫术般的说辞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"——年纪？你，你好意思说我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我感染了矿石病，死亡永远立于我身侧，只等时机成熟。华法琳，我的生命一定比你想象的更短暂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一定要说得那么严肃吗？我不是那个小丫头可露希尔，有些事情我可没法让你轻描淡写过去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你提出的议题相当的严肃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"......不管了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，听好了，其他人大概率不会和你说，但我会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"他是我们里最后的几个之一了。我不是慈善家，也没那么老好人，但......我们是萨卡兹人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我是血魔，那个老头是温迪戈，也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨卡兹人在这片大地上已经过得够难了。可能的话，我希望他能回到卡兹戴尔。来我们这里也行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是。华法琳，我不是萨卡兹人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你不答应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我尽力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我甚至记得他，华法琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"有你的承诺比什么都强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"别指望事情能有那么顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"但这次是你试着去做。只要是Dr.凯尔希去做了，什么样的结果我都接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你还没得到消息，但是你的建议提出得太晚。有一些事情已经不幸地发生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"前些时间切尔诺伯格的感染者诊所“阿撒兹勒”已经与我们交换了信息。我得知的不仅仅是他正服务于整合运动这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，你该清楚，如果你与他交战，你甚至可以尝出乌萨斯最暴虐时的刀锋是沾着咸味还是锈味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人该有意识地置罗德岛干员于险境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"有些患者的生命有限，但限度的高低取决于主治的医师。事在人为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......事在人为。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"以及我以前提醒过你......可能你又忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会因此惩罚你，却可能做些一劳永逸的事情来永绝后患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不要说我可怕，华法琳。我们说好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“不许在任何场合——哪怕是罗德岛——再提起‘魔王’二字。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"永远不许。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"全员，稍息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......是我的错觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不。我也感觉到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，出现了意外状况。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"发生了什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是很确定，不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城好像......放慢了速度？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","aliases":["华法琳"]}]}
